{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction to playing method</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dream world without alarms, exams, and only stars whispering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Hinata Alice opened her eyes. She doesn't remember who she is, nor does she remember why her heart seems to hurt a bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She ran with her companions in the valley full of flowers, and also searched for her way home in the maze and tower together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the journey progressed, she gradually regained the unforgettable memories of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they find a way back? Or... is this really what she wants? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as the protagonist Alice in the game, making choices every moment, exploring areas with various actions, obtaining various cards, solving various puzzles and enemies. Find those rare props, synthetic items, and look for helpers. There are always multiple solutions to difficulties, broaden your thinking. Multiple side events, searching for secrets hidden behind the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lasts about 3-4 hours.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755350?t=1756197338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755350/d9da01d34ad7bed4e82cd77efc7b0fea5c1d1cb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756197338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755350/26c25e88065ca3a7774898e7a927c0dc6718a261/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756197338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755350/26c25e88065ca3a7774898e7a927c0dc6718a261/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756197338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction to playing method</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dream world without alarms, exams, and only stars whispering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Hinata Alice opened her eyes. She doesn't remember who she is, nor does she remember why her heart seems to hurt a bit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She ran with her companions in the valley full of flowers, and also searched for her way home in the maze and tower together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the journey progressed, she gradually regained the unforgettable memories of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they find a way back? Or... is this really what she wants? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as the protagonist Alice in the game, making choices every moment, exploring areas with various actions, obtaining various cards, solving various puzzles and enemies. Find those rare props, synthetic items, and look for helpers. There are always multiple solutions to difficulties, broaden your thinking. Multiple side events, searching for secrets hidden behind the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lasts about 3-4 hours.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["liluoailuoli"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755350/0ebde97b08a33e77467196807af76ae6b4cd7086/header.jpg?t=1756197338","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3755350/1969476602/fd8c402971afc57b9e575fd9ce28a7cc0c5d3dcd/1750382373/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747918952","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3755350/1969476602/fd8c402971afc57b9e575fd9ce28a7cc0c5d3dcd/1750382373/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747